{"ver": "0.1", "info": {"id": "fdXGD2", "date": "1617005060", "viewed": 28, "name": "\u041d\u0435\u044f\u0432\u043d\u044b\u0435 \u0444\u0443\u043d\u043a\u0446\u0438\u0438", "username": "Boria", "description": "\u0433\u0440\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0446\u044b \u043d\u0435\u044f\u0432\u043d\u044b\u0445 \u0444\u0443\u043d\u043a\u0446\u0438\u0439", "likes": 1, "published": 1, "flags": 0, "usePreview": 0, "tags": [], "hasliked": 0, "parentid": "Nsf3W2", "parentname": "\u041a\u0440\u0443\u0433 \u041a\u043e\u0442\u043e\u0440\u044b\u0439 \u0434\u0432\u0438\u0436\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f  "}, "renderpass": [{"inputs": [], "outputs": [{"id": "4dfGRr", "channel": 0}], "code": "void mainImage( out vec4 fragColor, in vec2 fragCoord )\n{\n    vec2 uv =50.0 * fragCoord/iResolution.xy-25.0;\n    float x = uv.x - sin(iMouse.x / 100.0);\n    float y = uv.y * (iResolution.y / iResolution.x);\n    float a = sin(iTime);\n    vec3 col;\n    \n    //vec3 col =vec3(0.8, y - a / 1000.0 - sin(3.0 * y / (x + a * y)) ,0.5);\n     x /= 4.0;\n     y/= -4.0;\n     float c = sin(x  / y * a * a);\n     c = 0.01 / c;\n    if (c >= 0.0) {\n    col = vec3(c  ,0.0 ,0.0);\n    }\n    else {\n    col = vec3( 0.0,0.0, -c);\n    }\n    \n    fragColor = vec4(col,1.0);\n}\n// x * x + y * y +10x -", "name": "Image", "description": "", "type": "image"}]}